sequenceDiagram
    participant R as ExperimentRunner
    participant M as QPSKModulator
    participant C as QuantumChannel
    participant D as HeterodyneDetector
    participant A as IAttack (sat/LO)
    participant E as ParameterEstimator
    participant AM as IAttackModel
    participant S as SecurityAnalyzer
    participant L as StatisticsLogger
    R->>M: generate(N)
    M-->>R: AliceSignal {keys, amplitudes}
    R->>C: transmit(amplitudes)
    C-->>R: bob_in (√T·a + шум)
    R->>D: measure(bob_in)
    D-->>R: Measurement {X, P}
    R->>A: apply(meas)
    A-->>R: искажённые X, P
    R->>E: estimate(xA, yB)
    E-->>R: ChannelEstimate {T̂, ξ̂, ДИ}
    R->>AM: computeEffect(T, V_A, ξ̂)
    AM-->>R: AttackResult {ξ_add}
    R->>S: compute(T, ξ_eff, V_A)
    S-->>R: SecurityMetrics {I_AB, χ_BE, K_β}
    R->>L: log(scenario, d, ...)
